{"id":"n69411-3-5","stage":4,"title":"용하다 · 幸运","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69411-3-5-1","ko":"시험에 떨어질 줄 알았는데 용하게도 붙었어요.","zh":"我还以为我会考试不及格呢，没想到居然通过了，真幸运。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어질","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"所理解、预测的情况（-ㄹ 줄 알다：以为会……）","explanation":"줄：所理解、预测的情况（-ㄹ 줄 알다：以为会……）","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았는데","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"용하게도","meaning":"幸运","explanation":"용하다：幸运；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"용하다","audio":"/audio/f90b6b139ff0e2827f2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69411","senseId":"3","lemma":"용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙었어요.","meaning":"考上，通过","explanation":"붙다：考上，通过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"所理解、预测的情况（-ㄹ 줄 알다：以为会……）","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"所理解、预测的情况（-ㄹ 줄 알다：以为会……）","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"f90b6b139ff0e282","term":"용하다","zh":"幸运","audio":"/audio/f90b6b139ff0e2827f2e.mp3","entryId":"69411","definition":"十分运气好。","pronunciation":["용ː하다"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"考上，通过","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"考试等合格。","pronunciation":["붇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc17d06c56c1ec81b0fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69411-3-5-2","ko":"정말 잘됐다.","zh":"真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘됐다.","meaning":"好，顺利","explanation":"잘되다：好，顺利；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"好，顺利","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"某事情或现象的结果好。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/713e7f216ec80565ddcd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69411","l